      "title": "Deployment awareness — UI surfaces, host constraints, and chat degradation",
      "description": "The agent must know its UI surface — gh-pages, local server, with/without MCP, or chat discussion only — because deployment surfaces are declared architectural facts that decide which tools apply, forbid request-time assumptions, and require graceful degradation to chat.",
